stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> planning
  planning --> awaiting_approval: 需要写入
  planning --> reviewing: 只读任务
  awaiting_approval --> acting: 批准
  awaiting_approval --> cancelled: 拒绝/取消
  acting --> verifying: 补丁完成
  acting --> failed: 工具失败
  verifying --> succeeded: 验证通过
  verifying --> repairing: 验证失败且有预算
  verifying --> failed: 验证失败且无预算
  repairing --> acting: 形成新补丁
  reviewing --> succeeded: 输出审查报告
  failed --> [*]
  succeeded --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
